      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pilsen_Historic_District"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood's name honors Plzeň, a Czech city, reflecting its origins as a Bohemian immigrant community.",
