      ],
      "source": "https://facts.net/world/cities/25-facts-about-pilsen/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1892, Thalia Hall was built and now serves as a music venue and event space, a landmark of the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://facts.net/world/cities/25-facts-about-pilsen/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pilsen's historic buildings often feature colorful murals and mosaics, adding to the neighborhood's artistic charm.",
